{
  "version": "4.0.0",
  "language": "zh-Hant",
  "language_raw": "Trad_Chinese",
  "source": "message/dat/Trad_Chinese/script/c03.dat",
  "paired_tbl": "message/dat/Trad_Chinese/script/c03.tbl",
  "matching": "TRAILING_MAX_SENTINEL",
  "entries": [
    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "c03_south_01",
      "hash64": "9C85E84B5E08CB1D",
      "text": "[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳在釀光市玩得還開心嗎？\\n這裡是充滿高科技和商業交易的城市喔！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "c03_south_13",
      "hash64": "9C894E4B5E0BAE46",
      "text": "從這裡往北就是主街道！\\c\\n被電子告示板圍繞的道路\\n是釀光這裡特有的景色喔。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 11,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "c03_south_37",
      "hash64": "9C82624B5E05B194",
      "text": "襪子最重要的就是要舒服！\\n畢竟這是時常穿在身上的東西啊。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "c03_south_38",
      "hash64": "9C82594B5E05A249",
      "text": "包包最重要的就是要時髦！\\n能收納多少東西是其次喔。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "c03_south_39",
      "hash64": "9C82584B5E05A096",
      "text": "這裡就是奇樹的道館……\\n總是在直播上看到的地方。超～感動啊～！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "c03_south_43",
      "hash64": "9C935E4B5E141DFB",
      "text": "你有沒有看上次的奇樹奇述直播？\\n她和莉普合作的那一集好棒喔！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "c03_south_44",
      "hash64": "9C93634B5E14267A",
      "text": "奇樹真的好可愛，對不對～！\\n她應該是目前最紅的直播主吧。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "c03_south_56",
      "hash64": "9C96E34B5E1735D1",
      "text": "在城鎮裡有些自然的綠意，\\n就能讓我這歷經滄桑的心被療癒呢。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "c03_south_57",
      "hash64": "9C96E24B5E17341E",
      "text": "住在釀光市，\\n每天感官都會大受刺激是吧。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "c03_south_85",
      "hash64": "9C6AD44B5DF1E169",
      "text": "好的，高級球是吧！\\c\\n它比超級球還要厲害，\\n我就先下單訂個３００個吧！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 9,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "c03_south_86",
      "hash64": "9C6AD14B5DF1DC50",
      "text": "我長大以後，\\n也要當網～紅～！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "c03_south_87",
      "hash64": "9C6AD24B5DF1DE03",
      "text": "世界上有\\n各式各樣的工作喔～！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "c03_south_127",
      "hash64": "09018B10CDDBBB0A",
      "text": "我原本要做三明治的，\\n結果竟然手頭沒有籤子……！\\r\\n這類耗材要多買一些比較好喔。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 24,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "c03_south_147",
      "hash64": "09088B10CDE1D9B8",
      "text": "我想吃錦匯鎮寶食堂的料理，\\n又覺得玻瓶市的海岱俱樂部也不錯……\\r\\n我們乾脆叫飛翔計程車吧？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 31,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "c03_south_148",
      "hash64": "09088A10CDE1D805",
      "text": "我待會要去捉寶可夢，\\n所以想吃些能提升捕獲力的料理～",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "c03_center_06",
      "hash64": "74451F601B310C00",
      "text": "有寶可夢在海上飛。\\n抓好時機……按快門！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "c03_center_30",
      "hash64": "74421F601B2ED629",
      "text": "這下面有船喔！\\n我好想到海底去看看喔～",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "c03_center_39",
      "hash64": "744226601B2EE20E",
      "text": "釀光市處處都有監視器，\\n治安維持得相當好！\\c\\n聽說在釀光道館的道館測驗中\\n會用上這些監視器拍到的影像呢。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 21,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "c03_center_51",
      "hash64": "745622601B3F844C",
      "text": "在焙固鎮體驗做陶器！\\n下個企劃案就推這個吧！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "c03_center_65",
      "hash64": "744C2E601B37442B",
      "text": "網路直播也很好啦，\\n但我就是想要在現場看寶可夢對戰！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "c03_center_69",
      "hash64": "744C2A601B373D5F",
      "text": "萊姆在網路上發表新歌了！\\n得快來聽聽啊！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "c03_center_70",
      "hash64": "744FB7601B3A62CD",
      "text": "莉普推出的限定版化妝品，\\n每一款都好棒！好難決定喔～！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "c03_center_73",
      "hash64": "744FB4601B3A5DB4",
      "text": "這高樓未免也太高了！\\n看著看著我脖子都酸了。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "label": "c03_center_74",
      "hash64": "744FB3601B3A5C01",
      "text": "聽說這５棟都是\\n帕底亞不動產的大樓喔。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "label": "c03_center_78",
      "hash64": "744FAF601B3A5535",
      "text": "這座城市裡的電力都是由叫做\\n光蚪仔的寶可夢幫忙發電的喔！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 25,
      "label": "c03_center_79",
      "hash64": "744FAE601B3A5382",
      "text": "我最推的偶像！登上了電子告示板！\\n我最推的偶像！偶爾會出現！\\r\\n啊啊……我的寇沙……！！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 30,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 26,
      "label": "c03_center_90",
      "hash64": "74641B601B4BB5C3",
      "text": "擁有過一次的招式學習器，\\n就能用招式學習器機製作呢。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 27,
      "label": "c03_center_99",
      "hash64": "746422601B4BC1A8",
      "text": "要是有會衝浪的坐騎寶可夢，\\n就算是跳進海裡也沒問題喔。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 28,
      "label": "c03_center_100",
      "hash64": "CBAABF4E39ACC931",
      "text": "這裡以前是用船去\\n搬運礦山礦石的港鎮。\\c\\n想不到現在竟然會變成\\n這～樣的商業城市呢。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 19,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 29,
      "label": "c03_center_110",
      "hash64": "CBA7B94E39AA8928",
      "text": "釀光市的釀光是把東西釀個精光？\\n還是釀到發光？\\c\\n既然有百萬伏特夜景，\\n那應該就是釀到發光囉？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 23,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 30,
      "label": "c03_north_21",
      "hash64": "B3085705CEB40C29",
      "text": "不是有個出名的博士嗎？\\n[VAR 0x1107(00FF,0101)]她他最近好像都沒出現在媒體上耶。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 12,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1107",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 31,
      "label": "c03_north_22",
      "hash64": "B3085405CEB40710",
      "text": "小匙鎮附近有個燈塔，\\n聽說那裡的１樓是個研究所喔。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 32,
      "label": "c03_north_28",
      "hash64": "B3085E05CEB4180E",
      "text": "換個外觀，\\n心情也會改變！\\c\\n選擇穿什麼樣的衣服，\\n也會影響１天的各種事情，對吧！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 13,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 33,
      "label": "c03_north_40",
      "hash64": "B2F3D205CEA28120",
      "text": "傷藥、食材，\\n還有精靈球！\\r\\n有沒有漏買了什麼呢？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 13,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 34,
      "label": "c03_north_41",
      "hash64": "B2F3D305CEA282D3",
      "text": "到時候就用飛翔計程車\\n輕輕鬆鬆直飛友好商店吧。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 35,
      "label": "c03_north_42",
      "hash64": "B2F3D405CEA28486",
      "text": "[EMPTY 44]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "BDFF",
          "args_hex": [
            "002C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 36,
      "label": "c03_north_71",
      "hash64": "B2FDE305CEAAF288",
      "text": "奇樹她從好幾年前\\n就在做網路直播呢。\\r\\n……她到底是幾歲呀？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 18,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 37,
      "label": "c03_north_75",
      "hash64": "B2FDE705CEAAF954",
      "text": "這隻勒克貓的毛色\\n是不是超帥的啊～！\\c\\n每次對戰後，\\n我都會馬上幫牠寶可夢洗澡澡呢。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 18,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 38,
      "label": "c03_north_79",
      "hash64": "B2FDDB05CEAAE4F0",
      "text": "有一天我要變成有錢人，\\n然後說「從這裡到這裡我全都要！」\\r\\n……這是我的夢想喔～！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 28,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 39,
      "label": "c03_north_86",
      "hash64": "B31C5805CEC4B6E6",
      "text": "我嚼、我嚼、我嚼嚼。\\c\\n在釀光道館進行的挑戰，\\n都會被網路直播喔。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 10,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 40,
      "label": "c03_north_87",
      "hash64": "B31C5905CEC4B899",
      "text": "我喝、我喝、我喝喝。\\c\\n不久前的道館直播裡有個叫妮莫的人，\\n她的寶可夢好厲害喔！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 10,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 41,
      "label": "c03_north_95",
      "hash64": "B31FDB05CEC7CB56",
      "text": "聽說學院裡有很多書喔！\\c\\n等我入學以後，\\n我要讀遍《OH！超自然文化》！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 11,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 42,
      "label": "c03_north_103",
      "hash64": "E28B57DE37061B1A",
      "text": "從這前面的燈塔\\n可以把釀光市盡收眼底喔。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 43,
      "label": "c03_north_106",
      "hash64": "E28B54DE37061601",
